_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105183","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105183.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105183.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-11T14:56:31Z"},"body":"Currently, the shader editor has two modes, where the `file` menu button starts above the file list, then migrates to above the text editor when a file is selected, increasing the size of the file list vbox. This PR pulls the menu bars from the text editor above both the file list and the editor in order to be more consistent with the GDScript editor.\r\n\r\nThis PR also renames the properties `left_panel` -> `main_container` and `main_split` -> `files_split` to reflect this change in organization.\r\n\r\nIteration on #100287\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"961\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-04-09 at 3 04 18 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b685113-28c1-436c-8135-03e686886dd4\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"960\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-04-09 at 3 02 26 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/facf30f8-7917-4762-afdd-99dba95762bd\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u